    <briefdescription>
<para>Integer-Only Goertzel Algorithm Single-Frequency Tone Detector. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides a zero-malloc fixed-point implementation of the Goertzel algorithm for efficient single-frequency magnitude evaluation and DTMF tone decoding on resource-constrained microcontrollers without running full FFTs. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
